# Four 10 ms gates on TR1, and three 1 ms triggers on TR2 (the last one
# left high). Trigger inputs are not debounced (journal/D-019): TR1 must
# count four edges, TR2 three.
ticks 120
2 trigger 1 high
12 trigger 1 low
22 trigger 1 high
32 trigger 1 low
42 trigger 1 high
52 trigger 1 low
62 trigger 1 high
72 trigger 1 low

# Single-tick triggers, the common Eurorack width at the 1 kHz tick.
80 trigger 2 high
81 trigger 2 low
85 trigger 2 high
86 trigger 2 low
90 trigger 2 high
